Template: fleetwarden-agent/server
Type: string
Description: FleetWarden management server address:
 Enter the address of your FleetWarden management server, for example
 https://em.example.com. Leave it empty to configure the agent later with
 "fleetwarden-agent configure".
Description-nl.UTF-8: Adres van de FleetWarden management server:
 Vul het adres van je FleetWarden management server in, bijvoorbeeld
 https://em.example.com. Laat het leeg om de agent later in te stellen met
 "fleetwarden-agent configure".

Template: fleetwarden-agent/token
Type: password
Description: Enrollment token:
 Enter the enrollment token from the "Add client" wizard of the management
 server. The token decides which device group this machine joins.
Description-nl.UTF-8: Enrollment-token:
 Vul het enrollment-token in uit de "Add client"-wizard van de management
 server. Het token bepaalt in welke apparaatgroep deze machine komt.
